==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|'d<id:would><qq:contraction>}}
* {{alt|en|wou'd||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|ang:wolde|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|ang|wolde}}, past tense of {{m|ang|willan}}, predecessor of {{m|en|will}}.

The loss of {{IPAchar|/l/}} in this word is probably due to weak stress, as in {{m|en|should}} and {{m|en|could}} (though in the latter, the {{IPAchar|/l/}} was due to the analogy of the former two).<ref name="Dobson">{{R:en:Dobson:1957|II|4|462}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
